% nougat.mmd placeholder for OSTI 3023480
% ---------------------------------------
% Rationale:
%   Nougat is a Meta Research OCR pipeline optimised for equations and
%   tables in scientific PDFs (output = MathPix Markdown, .mmd). We do
%   not have a pre-computed nougat parse for this paper in the central
%   LUCID/parsed-corpus (verified via `find ~/Dropbox/LUCID-100 -name
%   '*3023480*'` -> empty). Running nougat fresh would take a GPU
%   (Polaris queue) and days of turn-around, well outside a single
%   subagent wave.
%
%   For the analytic-reproduction task the pdftotext-layout extraction
%   in `marker.md` captured every numeric parameter (R_0, a, B_a,
%   n_ea, T_ea, q, n_f/n_e, T_f/T_i), the analytic frequency claim
%   (90 kHz), and the full reference list. That was sufficient to run
%   the reproduction to a SPOT-CHECK verdict. Equations were read
%   directly from the paper text; no equation-heavy OCR was needed.
%
%   If a future wave needs a true nougat-quality equation dump, run:
%       source ~/env.sh  # on uicgpu
%       nougat /path/to/paper.pdf --out extraction/ --model 0.1.0-base
%   and drop the resulting nougat.mmd here.
%
% See marker.md in this directory for the full text of the paper.
